積極的で優位性が感じられる様子\n唄音ウタ：不器用で受け身な様子\n上記を意識して、過去に描かれたこちらのイラスト（https://x.com/i/status/1967582454782558413）のような雰囲気があるととても嬉しいです。\nキャラクターデザインの詳細はお任せいたします。\n\n【使用用途】\n個人での観賞に使用いたします。\n私のXアカウントで納品して頂いた作品を紹介したいと考えております。\n\n内容や金額に問題がありましたら、遠慮なくお断り頂いて構いません。ご検討頂けると幸いです。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 824697, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "錬宮", "screen_name": "neh38h", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1468994625322958858/6Yvo3o9w.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1298685431320461312/1653186720/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 1057632, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "07", "screen_name": "sobakonattou07", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1844812683226619904/4AKjeuiK.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2552540090/1728678149/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": 14, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 1616192, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": ".だぶ.", "screen_name": "mmm_ma_pmpm", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2072368701593251840/XUcEIyNi.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1441658690507972617/1788910408/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, 